---
import { CheckIcon, ShieldWarningIcon } from "@phosphor-icons/react";
const policies = ["Private IP protection", "Request budgets", "DNS revalidation", "No automated candidate crawling", "No login interaction"];
---

<section id="safety" class="section shell safety-section" aria-labelledby="safety-title"><div class="safety-copy"><p class="section-label"><span class="lang-id">Batas aman di setiap langkah</span><span class="lang-en">Guardrails at every step</span></p><h2 id="safety-title"><span class="lang-id">Keamanan adalah bagian dari model investigasi.</span><span class="lang-en">Safety is part of the investigation model.</span></h2><p><span class="lang-id">Kebijakan diperiksa sebelum navigasi dan ketika tujuan berubah. Aksi yang diblokir menjadi event yang dapat diaudit—bukan kegagalan diam-diam.</span><span class="lang-en">Policy is evaluated before navigation and again when a destination changes. A blocked action becomes an auditable event—not a silent failure.</span></p><div class="policy-block"><header><span><span class="lang-id">Aksi diblokir</span><span class="lang-en">Blocked action</span></span><strong>Policy event · #0048</strong></header><div class="policy-block__body"><span class="shield-mark"><ShieldWarningIcon aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><h3><span class="lang-id">Navigasi eksternal tidak aman</span><span class="lang-en">Unsafe external navigation</span></h3><p><span class="lang-id">Domain kandidat memerlukan persetujuan manusia</span><span class="lang-en">Candidate domain requires human approval</span></p></div></div><footer><span><span class="lang-id">Aksi dicegah</span><span class="lang-en">Action prevented</span></span><code>safe_navigation_required</code></footer></div></div><div class="policy-list">{policies.map((policy, index) => <article><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span><i><CheckIcon aria-hidden="true" /></i><h3>{policy}</h3><p>{index === 0 ? "Loopback and private ranges are rejected before collection." : index === 1 ? "Time, page, and interaction limits stay explicit." : index === 2 ? "Destinations are checked again before browser use." : index === 3 ? "Candidates wait for a recorded human decision." : "Public, read-only interaction only."}</p></article>)}</div></section>
